## Why This Is Dangerous

When you insert unsanitized user input directly into HTML, malicious users can inject:
- JavaScript code that steals cookies/session tokens
- Scripts that redirect users to phishing sites
- Code that modifies page content
- Keyloggers or other malicious functionality

## Example of the Vulnerable Code (DO NOT USE)

```javascript
